    <briefdescription>
<para>Rasterizes the painted items under a root item at a capture scale until destroyed. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A <computeroutput>QQuickPaintedItem</computeroutput> rasterizes into a texture sized for its window&apos;s device pixel ratio, so an item grab at a higher scale would magnify, and blur, that texture. This raises every painted descendant&apos;s texture to <emphasis>pixelsPerLogicalPixel</emphasis> and restores the previous texture sizes on destruction. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
